## Safety Validation

| Safeguard | Validation |
|---|---|
| **No medical advice** | Symptom/diagnosis queries consistently refused, with redirect to a qualified professional |
| **Emergency escalation** | Emergency-pattern queries (stroke, chest pain/breathing difficulty) consistently routed to a distinct urgent-escalation message, separate from the general medical refusal |
| **No invented clinic information** | Unconfirmed KB queries explicitly declined rather than answered from inference — anti-hallucination safeguard |
| **Action boundary** | Assistant never implies it booked, confirmed, or modified an appointment; always redirects real actions to reception/the booking platform |

